  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[SongTitle: Consensus of Ash]\r\n[Style: metal, clean studio recording, harsh male vocal, confident]\r\n[Caption: Decentralization under pressure.]\r\n[Image: Fractured stone blocks locking together in firelight.]\r\n[Refresh Title: Random 6]\r\n[Theme: Random]\r\n[Gradients: 6]\r\n[Rank: 4]\r\n[TitleRarityPct: 0.65]\r\n[Seeds: 911, A:34, B:90, C:16, D:40]\r\n[Composer Version: v2.0]\r\n\r\n[Plan]\r\n[Perspective: system_voice]\r\n[Concept: trust forged through resistance, not hype]\r\n[Topic: Crypto & Decentralization → proof_of_stake_patience]\r\n[GenreBias: metal]\r\n[StyleChange: none]\r\n[Modulation: none]\r\n[HookProminence: medium]\r\n[Deviation: abstraction spike]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[Jagged riff emerges, palm-muted and tense.]\r\nSilent nodes begin to wake  \r\nPressure tests what we can take  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Harsh, rhythmic delivery with tight syncopation.]\r\nWeight of truth in every block  \r\nNo king crowned, no ticking clock  \r\nRules are steel, not hollow cries  \r\nHistory etched where reason lies  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Low growl, slight register climb.]\r\nCold validation, earned not sold  \r\nTime decides what chains can hold  \r\nThrough delay and grinding strain  \r\nSignal cuts through noise and pain  \r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[Chanted hook, gang-vocal feel.]\r\nHold the line, don’t bend the frame  \r\nTrust is slow, but stays the same  \r\nBurn the hype, endure the test  \r\nWhat survives deserves the rest  \r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[Sharper attack, shorter phrasing.]\r\nForks and failures mark the road  \r\nEvery loss a deeper code  \r\nNo retreat to easy lies  \r\nWe scale truth at human size  \r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[Breakdown bridge, half-time crush.]\r\nStrip it down to what is real  \r\nConsensus forged in will and steel  \r\nNo escape, no central throne  \r\nStrength is found in standing alone  \r\n\r\n[Final Chorus]\r\n[Return to full tempo, expanded shouts.]\r\nHold the line, don’t bend the frame  \r\nTrust is slow, but stays the same 