  "lyrics": {
    "rawText": "\nSilent nodes begin to wake  \nPressure tests what we can take  \n\nWeight of truth in every block  \nNo king crowned, no ticking clock  \nRules are steel, not hollow cries  \nHistory etched where reason lies  \n\nCold validation, earned not sold  \nTime decides what chains can hold  \nThrough delay and grinding strain  \nSignal cuts through noise and pain  \n\nHold the line, don’t bend the frame  \nTrust is slow, but stays the same  \nBurn the hype, endure the test  \nWhat survives deserves the rest  \n\nForks and failures mark the road  \nEvery loss a deeper code  \nNo retreat to easy lies  \nWe scale truth at human size  \n\nStrip it down to what is real  \nConsensus forged in will and steel  \nNo escape, no central throne  \nStrength is found in standing alone  \n\nHold the line, don’t bend the frame  \nTrust is slow, but stays the same  \nFrom the ash, the blocks align  \nDecentralized by design  \n\nWhen the dust has cleared away  \nOnly tested chains remain  \n"
  },
